# secrets
.env

# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# project artifacts (large, machine-specific)
artifacts/
benchmarks/

# Machine-local generated state: the whole default working directory, not just
# one file in it. `.npu_rag/` holds the LanceDB index, the compiled NPU graphs
# and the ingest database, and every one of them is derived, large, and
# specific to this machine.
#
# This is a PRIVACY boundary, not only a size one. `index/schema.py` stores each
# chunk's `text` column verbatim, so a committed index would publish the
# contents of the personal archive it was built from - not merely vectors.
# Measured 2026-10-11: `.npu_rag/artifacts/` was already covered, but only
# incidentally by the bare `artifacts/` pattern above, while
# `.npu_rag/lancedb/chunks.lance/...` was fully committable and `git status`
# offered it for staging.
#
# Keep this as the directory, so a new sibling (a cache, a manifest, a log)
# is covered the day it appears rather than the day someone notices.
.npu_rag/

